WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.190
Hey everyone Diavolo here and today we’re
finally back after a few months break from

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:07.890
Chainsaw Man, to get straight back into the
next Dating Denji Arc from the Academy Saga

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:08.890
or Part 2.

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:15.370
For those curios as to where I was with CSM,
cause I saw ya comments, I had to wait for

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:18.199
those chapters to build up and allow to me
to fully binge the series, catching back up

00:00:18.199 --> 00:00:20.330
on the Fujimoto goodness i've missed out on
for a little bit now.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:24.320
After complete my Chainsaw Man fasting, I
can say it was more than worth it.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:28.010
I always enjoy just sitting back and having
my mind blown with just how creative this

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:30.740
man actually is and this arc is no different.

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:35.040
Its might be slower in parts, but we get to
see an old Devil friend, Asa and Denji’s

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:39.040
characters finally connect on a different
level and damn the foreshadowing as to what

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.060
could come next up is mental.

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:44.931
So if you want more chainsaw man content,
help push this video to 5k likes so I know

00:00:44.931 --> 00:00:51.420
your all keen on the next arc, but either
way sit back and relax as we watch Asa Mitaka

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:52.661
make a complete fool of herself!

00:00:52.661 --> 00:00:54.720
So, Denji still stuck with Asa at the Aquarium
building (remember thats where we left chainsaw

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.980
man at the end of the last arc, Asa from memory
bumped into Fami who showed up during our

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:58.980
duo’s date).

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:02.920
Either way, Denji explains to her that the
Eternity Devil has taken over the building

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:05.049
but she refuses to believe him.

00:01:05.049 --> 00:01:10.020
Having walked over 100 meters in a straight
line, Asa wonder how long the hallway is.

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:13.290
Denji tries to convince her that it is the
Eternity Devils thing.

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:17.400
Still, she screams at him to shut up as she
cant believe the fact that Denji is even a

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:21.250
devil hunter, instead asking him to stop making
things up while confidently claiming that

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:24.280
she knows more as she’s actually in the
Devil Hunter club.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:29.040
From a distance The Devil Hunter Club members
all pull up along side and even back up Asa

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.860
by revealing that she actually knows a lot
about Devils.

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:37.500
While Denji who btw has no idea who the Devil
Hunter club members are, Hiruka, the president

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.920
of the group, introduces himself but immediately
gets cut off in a savage manner by Denji who

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:45.160
notices that Yoshida actually showed up aswell.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:48.630
Standing there, Yoshida tells Denji that he
ended up in this whole mess just because he

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:55.020
wanted to check out some fishes at the aquarium
but got trapped there instead by a nasty devil.

00:01:55.020 --> 00:02:02.829
Seigi informs Yoshida that the guy who turned
up turns out to be the guy who went from Civilian

00:02:02.829 --> 00:02:06.860
Devil Hunter to Public Safety Devil Hunter
while still in High School.

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:11.290
Again the Student Council President introduces
himself BUT just like last time he’s cut

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:15.690
off as Kobeni’s brother Higashimiya, shows
up and reveals that this isn’t a dream,

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:17.690
they’re being attacked by a real-life devil.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:22.180
On top of that, he reveals that he never really
wanted to join the Devil Hunter Club and that

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:24.550
he only did so because his mother said it’d
get him a scholarship.

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:29.390
NOW THIS IS A TRUE MAMA’S BOY and I FREEEAKING
LOVE the fact that this is so similar to the

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:34.980
first time we meet the Eternity Devil with
Kobeni freaking out, but also so different

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:39.470
as pretty much every facet of the story has
changed!

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:44.110
Anyways, Its explained that a devil’s power
makes the hallway go on forever and the only

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:47.239
way out is if they kill the devil or themselves.

00:02:47.239 --> 00:02:51.970
Wanting to know if they saw any Devils beforehand
Denji asks, only to be told no.

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:56.230
Asa remembering what Famine had previously
told her, wonders if she should turn Denji

00:02:56.230 --> 00:03:01.030
into a weapon or kill Haruka, who she believes
is the real Chainsaw Man.

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:05.000
Asa believes that if she can actually kill
him, then she could get her body back from

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.190
Yoru without turning anyone around into a
weapon.

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:12.150
Moving forth through the building, the members
of the Devil Hunter Club are able to obtain

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:16.099
fish and water from an endlessly repeating
staff room that they found.

00:03:16.099 --> 00:03:19.520
Together, they eventually figure out a way
to cook by starting a fire with someone's

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.780
lighter and the scrap newspapers lying around.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:27.200
A few moments later, Asa reveals that she
can’t eat fish since it looks too much like

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.689
a dead animal and totally it grosses her out.

00:03:29.689 --> 00:03:33.690
She hurrilidly leaves the room and sighs in
front of the door, before bumping into Denji

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.269
who gives her a suspicious look.

00:03:35.269 --> 00:03:39.849
It turns out Denji was just picking up a 1000
yen bag from the ground, but Asa accuses him

00:03:39.849 --> 00:03:41.380
of being a thief.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:45.880
Filled with ill contempt for our vomit eating
creep, Asa gives Denji a moral lesson knowing

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:49.780
almost nothing about the things Denji would
actually do for money all while continuing

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:51.360
to argue with him.

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:54.980
After a few tense moments between the two
where they both tell each other to go to hell

00:03:54.980 --> 00:04:00.120
(which ima just say is probably a massive
foreshadowing in it self), Asa believes that

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:02.819
she should really turn Denji into a weapon.

00:04:02.819 --> 00:04:07.360
After he leaves, she stands there alone for
a moment and confirms to herself that she

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:13.010
isn't a loser like Denji and will contribute
to the Devil Hunters Club somehow.

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:18.530
Back in the room now, Asa takes out her mom’s
phone looking for a signal, which of course,

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:20.560
got all of the group members excited.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:24.820
When Asa manages to find a signal bar for
one second, she immediately stretches her

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:29.350
arm in an attempt to find it again, but as
everyone coomes with just how lucky they are,

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:32.960
and that they’re all gonna be saved, Asa
just ends up tripping over her own feet and

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.000
falls to the ground.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.000
Guess what?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:40.020
like it would have been fine if it wasn't
some bung ass flip phone, but due to her mom

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:43.820
skimping out on the modern device her phone
snapped in half as it fell to the ground.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:44.820
AND OML this brings back some memories, in
school when I was like 13 I used to have this

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:45.820
sick super dope army grade flip phone.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:46.820
I could throw this thing like 50 meters in
to the air and it'd survive ANYTHING, until...

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:47.820
one day it flipped open in midair and helicoptered
its way to death, snapping like Asa’s phone.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.840
Looking at just how pathetic Asa is, Haruka
sighs and comments that he expected better

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:50.840
from her.

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:55.120
Instead Asa complains all the time, failing
to come through in clutch always letting them

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:56.120
down.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:05:01.070
Hearing this, Asa panics and immediately leaves
the room to cry in isolation outside the room.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:06.030
Lying down now, Asa ponders whether the Aquarium
is from hell since once you get in, there’s

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.040
no way out.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.789
The hallway goes on endlessly, and clock hands
don’t even move!

00:05:08.789 --> 00:05:12.570
You can’t even flush the toilets here, and
to top things off, the fishes start rotting

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:14.430
in their tanks.

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:18.340
Having moved into the hallway himself, Haruka
throws some abuse at Asa for breaking the

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:21.630
cell phone or else they would have escaped.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:26.800
Asa believes that Haruka is Chainsaw Man and
asks why he doesn't do something, which actually

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.880
confuses Haruka who wonders what the hell
she’s even talking about.

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:35.560
Pointing out the starter on his chest, Haruka
clarifies that the starter is a surgical implant,

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:39.990
and it’s one of the reasons why people say
that the man who comes the closest to Chainsaw

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:40.990
Man.

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:44.460
That’s why he’s President of the Chainsaw
Man Society’s High School chapter, Runner-up

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:49.410
in the Chainsaw Man Quiz Show Contest, and
owner of every piece of Chainsaw Man Merchandise!

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:51.260
Bro is a simp for Chainsaw Man.

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.260
Be like bro.

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:56.810
Just to make sure she’s correct, Asa asks
Haruka about being Chainsaw Man one last time,

00:05:56.810 --> 00:06:00.460
to which he starts hysterically laughing while
telling here that if he was Chainsaw Man,

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:03.750
they could have broken out of the hellhole
in no time.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:08.979
Seconds after he begins screaming for chainsaw
man to come and save him, sending a fat SOS

00:06:08.979 --> 00:06:12.400
to Denji who’s right around the corner yarning
with Yoshida.

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:16.510
As the two stand there in silence, Yoshida
speaks up about how it’s our boy Denji’s

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:18.139
cue to help Asa.

00:06:18.139 --> 00:06:21.699
Denji on the other hand reveals that he was
able to kill the devil last time because the

00:06:21.699 --> 00:06:27.389
devil himself came at them but this devil
is nowhere to be found so how can he defeat

00:06:27.389 --> 00:06:28.389
it?

00:06:28.389 --> 00:06:32.360
All of a sudden, Yoshida reveals a cellphone
that he also had hidden, but points out he

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:35.819
hasn't been able to find a signal and it feels
like it’s been over three days that they've

00:06:35.819 --> 00:06:37.580
been trapped in the aquarium.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:41.970
In his eyes everyone seems to have given up,
and Yoshida himself has also made peace with

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:42.970
death.

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:48.020
Turning to Denji, he asks if Chainsaw Man
would eat the DEATH devil for them, leaving

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:52.750
our man with a spaced out look, clueless as
to what Yoshida was referring too.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:58.520
As time moves forth, Denji goes to Asa who’s
sitting inside one of the smaller fish tanks.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:03.660
He notes that the others are all starting
to lose, but wonders how she’s holding out.

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:08.460
Hearing that she’s hungry, Denji just tells
her to eat some fish but she refuses claiming

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:09.680
she cant eat it.

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:14.380
She also apologizes to Denji for asking him
on a date, explaining that it’s her fault

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:18.300
for how he ended up in this situation, and
how Denji probably has no idea that she’s

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:19.710
trying to turn him into a weapon.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:24.210
However now, even starving and pushed into
a corner, she just cant do it.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:28.919
She reveals that she doesn’t have the guts
to do anything and has no idea what’s right

00:07:28.919 --> 00:07:29.919
or wrong.

00:07:29.919 --> 00:07:33.849
Her entire below average life has just been
one long string of attempts to avoid any mistakes

00:07:33.849 --> 00:07:36.280
and thats why she’s just a total bore.

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:40.780
Denji not overly concerned with what she was
muttering, sits right in front of her and

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:43.139
notes that yeah she cant eat fish right?

00:07:43.139 --> 00:07:48.449
Then flipping out a star fish as if its like
the left leg of exodia, he asks Asa if she’s

00:07:48.449 --> 00:07:49.449
ever tried this?

00:07:49.449 --> 00:07:54.800
Being our big brain neuro divergent genius,
Asa immediately protested as a starfish is

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.900
toxic and has to be boiled first.

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:02.310
Of course though, our boy right here is just
as resourceful as ever, so they look for a

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:05.840
random pot lid and a pot to boil the starfishes.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:10.930
While they’re cooking, Asa notices tons
of school hats lying right by her side.

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:14.900
Denji reveals that he collected these hats
to sell them after he gets out of the Aquarium,

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:17.840
causing our girl to question Denji’s obsession
with money.

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:22.610
Denji clarifies that he just wants to support
his “sorta-friend sorta-little sister thats

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:24.310
living with him”.

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:28.740
Denji being the muppet he is believes that
Nayuta is smart enough to go to college and

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:31.229
because of that is saving for her tuition.

00:08:31.229 --> 00:08:36.390
He reveals to Asa that before he got to where
he is now his life was super crappy and he

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:38.370
wants her to have a normal one.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:43.229
Soon, the starfishes get ready and the duo
start smashing them back.

00:08:43.229 --> 00:08:47.300
Asa says that feeding on starfishes isn’t
enough, but looking over to her right she

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:51.280
notices dried fish and after asking Denji,
tries to eat them.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:56.220
She hesitates at first but eventually manages
to chow down with tears in her eyes.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:09:00.430
Thinking that this was fun, Denji says that
everything Asa says is boring but she's interesting

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:01.430
to watch.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.430
Oooh if these ain’t early symptoms of simping,
then I don’t know what it is, anyways.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.510
On the other hand, Asa is confused by this
statement until the power of self-confidence

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:09.080
hits her causing her to stand up and say that
Denji has a good eye for people, and with

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:13.550
this new level of confidence flowing through
her she says that she’s charming isn't she.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:17.990
Our simp boy Denji tells how he loves Asa’s
attitude and reveals how it reminds him of

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:24.800
an old friend who’s most likely to be Power
(may her soul rest in peace).

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:29.680
After munching on dried fish, Asa asks for
Denji’s help to find a way out of the Aquarium.

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:33.149
Asa explains the plan which is nothing more
than to collect money.

00:09:33.149 --> 00:09:37.820
Rushing down the hall, Denji further discusses
their plan and how there is a thousand yen

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:41.329
in the backpack on the ground, and there is
also a wallet with fourteen thousand yen inside

00:09:41.329 --> 00:09:43.110
it back at the lounge.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:47.610
Asa who was previously giving Denji a moral
lesson in theft, now also wants to steal money

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:49.330
in order to escape the Aquarium.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.330
LOOK WHO DECIDED TO SWITCH SIDES.

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:54.290
Pushing forth, its shown that as the two rob
the Eternity Devil over and over again their

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:57.410
having the best time of their lives, joking
around and laughing.

00:09:57.410 --> 00:10:03.910
After they’re done collecting the money,
Asa asks for the entire bag of money.

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:07.550
Denji hesitates at first since he’s giving
away such a huge amount of money, like its

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:09.610
literally over a million yen now.

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:14.300
BUT she manages to persuades him by saying
that she’ll grant him any request once they

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:15.500
do escape.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:18.269
Immediately Denji gives away all of the collected
money to Asa.

00:10:18.269 --> 00:10:23.110
While collecting it she asks Denji to just
listen to her for now, so go over and stand

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:25.890
in a corner with his eyes closed and ears
covered!

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:31.460
Doing exactly what he’s told, Denji walks
over and stands up against the wall.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:35.570
Telling herself to have some confidence, Asa
reminds herself that regardless of how absurd

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:39.450
the reasoning may seem, it ultimately comes
down to her own perspective.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.930
She urges herself to have faith in her abilities
and decides to set aside the million yen bag

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:45.930
to purchase the Aquarium.

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:50.250
With her eyes still closed and the bag along
with Denji seemingly vanished she places her

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:54.520
hands against the glass and commands the Aquarium
Spear.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:58.410
Money is a sensitive topic to talk about,
but while Denji is still skeptical about his

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:02.740
decision of handing over the money to Asa,
he still believes that after obeying Asa,

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:06.110
he will get what he wishes for, so it’s
all good.

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:11.010
Randomly, Denji sees a penguin coming his
way, so he starts playing with it.

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:15.019
Suddenly, Denji holding this cute lil penguin,
along with all of the students appear outside

00:11:15.019 --> 00:11:16.080
the Aquarium.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:21.190
Obviously this was thanks to Asa who managed
to weasel her way out of the original conditions.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:26.279
If you forgot the original conditions were
that Asa had to kill the Chainsaw Man to leave

00:11:26.279 --> 00:11:32.000
the Aquarium.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:36.490
The Eternity Devil also shows up right in
front of her screams that this wasn't the

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:39.560
deal, you can’t buy an aquarium with a measly
million yen.

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:44.310
Seeing the devil towering over Asa, Yoshida
quickly intervenes and saves our girl.

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:49.389
Having closed her eyes previously, Asa transforms
into Yoru who having read Asa’s memories,

00:11:49.389 --> 00:11:52.120
notes that of-course she’d feel guilty for
destroying an aquarium.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:57.500
Darting at her, the Eternity Devil's screams
for her to die, however Yoru easily manages

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:02.080
to defend herself with the Aquarium spear
and while getting ready to throw it asks if

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:03.880
the Devil was sure 1 million wasn't enough?

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:05.791
she was determined to prove her worth and
claim what she desired, no matter the cost.

00:12:05.791 --> 00:12:08.990
At last, Yoru sends the spear flying forth,
which in a matter of moments connects and

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:12.790
sends a plethora of sharks and other marine
life flying everywhere.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:16.720
In turn this attack also defeats the Eternity
Devil and leaves everyone nearby baffled with

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:18.190
the change in Asa.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:22.520
Atop a nearby building Famine remarks that
well that idea went to hell, then looking

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:27.180
down her eyes gaze catches Yoshida and the
two begin staring at each other.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:32.930
After the battle, Asa thanks Denji for walking
her home while calling it the worst date ever.

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:37.510
However, surprisingly, Denji enjoyed it as
he got to touch a penguin as well.

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:41.829
Awkwardly Denji brings up the request part
again and asks if Asa would still grant him

00:12:41.829 --> 00:12:47.709
any request; Intrigued Asa asks what kind
of request it was.

00:12:47.709 --> 00:12:51.440
Denji was filled with excitement as he proposed
going on another date with Asa.

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:54.880
YOU MIGHT’VE THOUGHT DENJI WAS GOING TO
ASK FOR SOMETHING LEWD, BUT NO!

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:58.370
He has his head set straight for the first
time in his life!

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:02.899
With his extensive dating experience, he eagerly
volunteered to be her guide, promising to

00:13:02.899 --> 00:13:07.230
show her the ropes of creating the most memorable
and extraordinary outings.

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:13.100
Well, his dating experience just sums up with
him being with the most dangerous woman in

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.100
the verse.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:19.279
BUT Asa's face instantly lit up with a gentle
smile, her heart beating rapidly with anticipation.

00:13:19.279 --> 00:13:24.840
It was at that moment that Yoru realized she
might be on the verge of falling in love.

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:28.300
However, even as Asa's emotions swirled within
her, she remained cautious.

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:29.300
Talk about trust issues, huh?

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:33.100
Putting her guard up, Yoru confessed to Asa
that she had never expected to develop feelings

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:36.110
for someone as unconventional and rough around
the edges as him.

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:41.010
Its only plausible because she shares in Asa’s
feelings aswell, still in her crazed eye’s

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:44.510
she believes they they can still continue
with the original plan.

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:48.690
Confused Asa lowers her head before randomly
walking forth and affectionately patting Denji's

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:49.690
head.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:53.529
With her hand on his head its revealed that
Asa and Yoru had switched places and in that

00:13:53.529 --> 00:13:57.500
moment she chants the words "Denji Spinal
Cord Sword."

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.560
BUT IT DOESN’T SEEM TO WORK!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:04.620
Denji's confusion persisted as Yoru continuously
patted his head while saying “Denji Spinal

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:07.490
Cord Sword,” expecting it to trigger a transformation.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:12.509
Almost every lady Denji encountered has tried
to destroy him, and turn him into a tool.

00:14:12.509 --> 00:14:16.550
Funnily enough Yoru’s efforts proved to
be fruitless, leaving Denji perplexed and

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:18.480
unsure of what was even happening.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:23.310
Attempting to make sense of the situation,
Denji gently patted Asa on the head, then

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:28.410
with a sense of uncertainty, copied the words
"Asa Spinal Cord Sword" before walking off

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:31.630
and joking that this was a fun way to say
goodbye!

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:36.990
In a separate conversation, Asa and Yoru exchanged
thoughts on Denji's inability to transform

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:38.899
despite their efforts.

00:14:38.899 --> 00:14:40.620
Well, what can we say?

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:44.242
Denji is quite literally built different,
on a serious note though it probably has something

00:14:44.242 --> 00:14:47.850
to do with her feeling some kinda way bout
our man.

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:52.079
Frustration filled their voices as they mentioned
how annoying the situation is.

00:14:52.079 --> 00:14:55.910
Thinking on it, Asa questions if it means
Denji doesn't like her that way, not that

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.330
it really matters since she totally doesn't
either!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:03.209
Nevertheless Yoru points out that they both
share emotions, which is a new thing for her.

00:15:03.209 --> 00:15:06.459
Still they will take their time to actually
win Denji’s heart while searching for Chainsaw

00:15:06.459 --> 00:15:07.790
Man on a larger scale.

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:11.970
Yoru states that its probably best they get
some sleep, however Asa brings up the girl

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:15.779
who trapped everyone in the Aquarium and if
she was related to Yoru.

00:15:15.779 --> 00:15:19.959
Yoru clarifies that she was the Famine Devil
and she actually hadn't seen her in a while,

00:15:19.959 --> 00:15:22.740
hence why she didnt recognize her initially.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:27.259
Exhausted from their efforts, Yoru collapses
onto the bed, wanting to rest however, Asa,

00:15:27.259 --> 00:15:31.420
ever mindful of personal hygiene, offered
a well-intentioned suggestion.

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:36.610
She gently advised Yoru to take a bath before
settling down to sleep.

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:41.089
Asa and Yoru then went to bed, her mind consumed
by thoughts of Denji and the conflicting emotions

00:15:41.089 --> 00:15:43.280
his words had stirred within her.

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:47.950
She pondered over his heartfelt expressions,
spoken seemingly in contradiction to his lack

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:49.430
of fondness for her.

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:53.820
Asa's frustration grew, fueled by the belief
that if Denji truly disliked her, he shouldn't

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:56.550
have said such a sincere and compassionate
statement.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:16:00.350
She wrestled with the complexity of their
relationship finally ending on the take that

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:04.720
she’s quite unsatisfied with how irritating
he is and actually hates him.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:08.980
After a while and probably the next day after
class, Asa goes out and reunites with the

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:13.130
squad where Denji shares the ideas of his
“super best date ever.”

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:18.500
Denji suggests that he and Asa should watch
Mummy movies nonstop till 2 AM for only 2000

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.500
yen.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:23.829
2000 yen though, thats like 20 bucks and in
Asa’s eyes renting movies out would be much

00:16:23.829 --> 00:16:28.569
easier and more convenient, she also shares
the fact that she doesn’t like pricey dates.

00:16:28.569 --> 00:16:33.089
Slightly bummed out that she didnt go with
his plan, Denji agrees to her plan and panics

00:16:33.089 --> 00:16:36.890
when Asa suggests going over to his place
since its even cheaper that way.

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:41.709
Blown away with the change out events Denji
awkwardly tells Asa that there will be a few

00:16:41.709 --> 00:16:44.300
rules that she has to follow if she does come
over.

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:48.820
With her questioning this, he reveals that
you cant break these rules no matter what,

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:53.510
because if you do in the worst case scenario,
it could result in her death.

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:58.230
Sneaking up behind the duo, Haruka eavesdrops
on their conversation and gets alerted when

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:01.670
he hears Denji mention that someone can die.

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:05.770
The much-awaited day had finally arrived when
a girl was scheduled to visit Denji's humble

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:06.770
abode.

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:10.880
As anticipation filled the air, Denji took
a moment to caution Asa about a rule named

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.280
"Unbreakable Rule 1."

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:16.970
He emphasized the importance of refraining
from opening any other apartment door, ensuring

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:20.939
that their privacy and the sanctity of their
neighbors' spaces were respected.

00:17:20.939 --> 00:17:25.439
As Asa stepped inside, our simp boy Denji
guided her towards the cozy seating area right

00:17:25.439 --> 00:17:27.160
in front of the television.

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:31.780
Just as the excitement settled in, Denji revealed
the existence of a second rule which is to

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:33.820
refrain from opening the refrigerator.

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:38.090
But Asa already knew all too well the common
sense of never invading the sacred territory

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.860
of another person's fridge.

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:43.880
With the atmosphere brimming with curiosity
and amusement, Denji proceeded to disclose

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:45.830
the most vital rule which was rule number
3.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:50.150
He shared the delightful news that his roommate,
a lover of furry friends, had ventured out

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:54.460
to walk their beloved dogs; he also added
how his roommate is somewhat of a problem

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:59.450
child, so no matter what happens, Asa is prohibited
to make out with him in front of her.

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:02.510
Asa gets annoyed and flustered after hearing
Denji talk like she’ll actually make out

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.510
with him.

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:07.289
Asa starts sarcastically asking Denji whether
he thinks she likes him, to which Denji responds

00:18:07.289 --> 00:18:11.520
that he’s been thinking about how she asked
him on a date, so figured that she must 90

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:12.520
percent like him.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:16.850
Without any further discussion, Asa goes defensive
mode and clarifies that there is no way she

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:21.490
likes him, infact its actually the contrary,
she hates Denji more than anything.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:26.870
Asa reveals that just like Denji she also
has rules and needs to stay away from her

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:28.960
or he’ll just end up dead.

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:33.809
In an attempt to divert her attention, Asa
confesses that she initially agreed to the

00:18:33.809 --> 00:18:38.059
date with Denji as a means of distracting
herself, fully intending to leave right after

00:18:38.059 --> 00:18:39.610
watching the movie together.

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:44.650
As time passes, the weight of this revelation
finally dawns on Denji, causing him to question

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:47.179
whether Asa has been using him all along.

00:18:47.179 --> 00:18:52.650
Doubt begins to creep into his mind, wondering
if he's somehow at fault for the current predicament.

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:57.780
As these thoughts swirl in Denji's head, he
can't help but recall a distant memory.

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:01.610
Someone had once remarked that he smelled
like a dog, but rather than taking offense,

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:03.770
he had mistaken it for a compliment…

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:08.150
Now, in deep thought he wonders if there was
more to that comment than he initially thought.

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:11.830
Has his unique scent played a role in the
way others perceive him?

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:16.250
The question lingers in his mind, adding another
layer of self-doubt to his already tangled

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.250
emotions.

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:23.120
As Denji thought about his complicated situation,
he came to a simple conclusion: Asa must dislike

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:26.559
him because of the way he smells.

00:19:26.559 --> 00:19:31.220
Despite this, Denji couldn't deny the fact
he did slightly like her, but if this is how

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:33.220
it is then thats that.

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:52.840
With a resolution to improve himself, he decided
to stop sleeping with the dogs, however just

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:58.620
as he contemplated the absurdity of these
changes, a surprising twist occurred.

00:19:58.620 --> 00:20:03.370
Asa, transformed into Yoru, leaned forth and
passionately kissed him out of the blue.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:09.179
Denji's mind reeled with astonishment, trying
to make sense of the sudden turn of events.

00:20:09.179 --> 00:20:10.490
THIS WAS HIS ONE AND ONLY DREAM!

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:14.330
Yet, before he could fully comprehend the
situation, the door suddenly opened and a

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:16.169
pack of dogs entered the apartment.

00:20:16.169 --> 00:20:20.980
Turning around and screaming as the dogs begin
jumping on them, the notice a short shadowy

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:23.650
figure in the doorway.

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:28.289
Just when the situation couldn’t get worse,
Nayuta happened!

00:20:28.289 --> 00:20:32.900
She came back to the apartment and witnessed
Denji’s lewd make-out session.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:38.090
Pointing forth while calling Asa a thief,
a random chain appears from the tip of her

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:42.930
finger that shoots forth and implants itself
directly into the brain of the War Devil.

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:47.270
To Denji’s astonishment, Yoru immediately
hops on all fours and fearlessly unleashed

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:51.200
her own inner dog, barking back at the rowdy
canines.

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:55.670
What caught our boy more off-guard though
was that Yoru's barks proved to be a secret

00:20:55.670 --> 00:21:00.350
weapon, silencing the dogs and leaving them
utterly dumbfounded.

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:04.650
Nayuta witnessing it all burst into an evil
kind of laughter.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:10.000
Annoyed Denji who somehow didnt figure it
out, demands to know what Nayuta done, to

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:12.920
which the child proclaims that she turned
her into a DOG!

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:13.920
You know the parallels here is pretty funny,
just comparing it to Denji’s experience

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:14.920
with Makima, and when he turned into a dog.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:15.920
Its random watching Asa seemingly speed-run
everything that Denji’s been through previously.

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:17.720
Denji demands the reasoning as to why she’d
even do that, and Nayuta just casually states

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:20.429
that its because she put spit on her property.

00:21:20.429 --> 00:21:24.520
Baffled, Denji screams that he’s literally
his own property and demands that she turn

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:26.220
his friend back this instant.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:30.970
Nayuta denies it to start with, but after
Denji offers to cook her something she agree’s

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:32.539
to turn her back later.

00:21:32.539 --> 00:21:36.890
As time skipped forth its shown that like
every other puppy, Yoru had fallen asleep

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:41.850
between the dogs while cuddling them; on the
other hand, Denji and Nayuta have a meal amidst

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:43.590
their own chaos.

00:21:43.590 --> 00:21:48.210
Denji asks Nayuta to turn his friend back
into her original self, but knowing that every

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:52.530
girl Denji’s ever meet has tried to kill
him, questions what makes her different.

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:57.000
After hearing Denji’s laxed reply, Nayuta
states that she will return her to normal,

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:59.919
however only if Denji abides by two conditions.

00:21:59.919 --> 00:22:04.440
First, she demands to be able to eat ice cream
every day, while the other requires Denji

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:06.220
to never get friendly with Asa.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:10.559
Nayuta reasoning for this is that she simply
doesn't like Asa’s scent.

00:22:10.559 --> 00:22:15.580
Denji asks if she smells like a wet dog (obviously
mans trying to confirm his previous doubts),

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:18.970
Nayuta screams back though that wet dogs actually
smell nice.

00:22:18.970 --> 00:22:23.700
To fix everything that happened back at their
apartment, Nayuta explains that she’ll alter

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:26.960
Asa’s memories so she thinks Denji just
stood her up.

00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:31.700
Denji got a little worried to start with since
Asa might end up hating him, but Nayuta re-iterates

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:35.110
that he’s done with her either way so its
not like it even matters.

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:39.020
After completing the memory alteration, we
see Asa standing right in front of the high

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:41.960
school thinking that Denji stood her up.

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:45.760
Confused with it all, Yoru just pushes her
feelings aside and things its best they start

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:47.800
targeting a different boy.

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.080
On the way home now, she doubts herself, thinking
that he must've forgotten, not that she’d

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:53.080
ever care.

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:57.230
This was all to warn Denji to stay away from
her.

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:02.950
She didn't mean to spend that much money on
dating plus she also had to do her schoolwork,

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:05.540
so Asa is glad that she got stood up.

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:10.270
Nevertheless, she confesses to herself and
acknowledges this feeling of longing to experience

00:23:10.270 --> 00:23:15.670
even the tiniest desire for human contact,
but also realizes that such emotions arose

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:20.520
solely due to being with someone of the opposite
gender for an extended duration.

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:23.340
So basically, those were her hormones talking!!

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:27.799
At the end of the day, Asa’s priority is
to beat Chainsaw Man and get her body back,

00:23:27.799 --> 00:23:32.090
which means there’s no reason for Asa to
be stuck on Denji; especially since she actually

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:34.279
prefers solitude more than anything else.

00:23:34.279 --> 00:23:39.220
In that way, Asa might have an easier time
attaining her own personal happiness without

00:23:39.220 --> 00:23:41.050
relying on Denji.

00:23:41.050 --> 00:23:46.580
After a while and having returned to the school,
she starts to wonder what the is even wrong

00:23:46.580 --> 00:23:49.529
with her, all she should care about is getting
her body back.

00:23:49.529 --> 00:23:56.590
DAMN FUJIMOTO idk why but his writings just
resonate with me, that all enveloping fear

00:23:56.590 --> 00:24:02.640
of loneliness strikes some cord within me.

00:24:02.640 --> 00:24:09.620
EITHER WAY breaking that awkwardness, Yoshida
randomly shows up asking what’s wrong with

00:24:09.620 --> 00:24:11.660
Asa and why is she standing there.

00:24:11.660 --> 00:24:16.310
Then continuing with Yoshida’s random randomness,
he steps forth and asks if she’d like to

00:24:16.310 --> 00:24:18.210
keep him company for a bit?

00:24:18.210 --> 00:24:32.779
So that there brings us to the end of this
Dating Denji Arc, re-reading this section

00:24:32.779 --> 00:24:37.880
of CSM full on made me realize just how similar
both Asa and Denji are, like the personalities

00:24:37.880 --> 00:24:43.260
are polar opposites but the experiences seem
to be suuuper similar and im enjoying it so

00:24:43.260 --> 00:25:00.370
far.

00:25:00.370 --> 00:25:04.510
Next time and hopefully soon ill be back with
the FALLING DEVIL ARC, so if you are interested

00:25:04.510 --> 00:25:08.630
and want me to keep more upto date with Chainsaw
Man then leave a like and try help in pushing

00:25:08.630 --> 00:25:14.010
this video to 5k likes.

00:25:14.010 --> 00:25:17.510
Also if you are new around here and want content
just like this but for a multitude of different

00:25:17.510 --> 00:25:18.840
series, then make sure to subscribe.

00:25:18.840 --> 00:25:21.750
BUT either way for now its been ya professional
degenerate Diavolo and ill see you all in

00:25:21.750 --> 00:25:22.809
a bit, bye! &lt;3

